00:57:42,760 --> 00:57:44,670
- This is fun.
- It's hilarious, isn't it?

1312
00:57:45,100 --> 00:57:47,840
(Warm water is delivered shortly after.)

1313
00:57:47,840 --> 00:57:48,900
Okay.

1314
00:57:49,270 --> 00:57:50,710
(The colour of the water is strangely dark.)

1315
00:57:50,710 --> 00:57:54,480
It smells like there are oriental herbs in it, doesn't it?

1316
00:57:54,480 --> 00:57:55,580
Yes.

1317
00:57:55,740 --> 00:57:57,080
We have to do everything we can do here.

1318
00:57:57,080 --> 00:57:58,210
Right.

1319
00:57:58,510 --> 00:58:00,380
It's hot! Gosh, it's hot!

1320
00:58:02,420 --> 00:58:03,750
- It's hot.
- You're young.

1321
00:58:03,890 --> 00:58:06,050
(Joon is still too young to endure the hot foot bath.)

1322
00:58:06,490 --> 00:58:07,660
My heels are in.

1323
00:58:07,660 --> 00:58:08,920
(He barely manages to get his heels in the water.)

1324
00:58:09,260 --> 00:58:10,730
I want to ask them to make the water even hotter.

1325
00:58:10,730 --> 00:58:12,390
Really? Your skin will cook.

1326
00:58:15,800 --> 00:58:17,270
Goodness.

1327
00:58:17,600 --> 00:58:20,770
(The beautiful scenery captures their attention.)

1328
00:58:21,400 --> 00:58:22,700
What a view!

1329
00:58:22,700 --> 00:58:23,740
(The panoramic blue sea)

1330
00:58:23,740 --> 00:58:25,610
- It's wild.
- Wild.

1331
00:58:26,670 --> 00:58:29,480
(Sunlight sparkles on the water like jewels.)

1332
00:58:31,450 --> 00:58:34,650
(The train runs through lush mountains, with the sea in view.)

1333
00:58:34,950 --> 00:58:38,420
(An emerald-blue beach comes into full view.)

1334
00:58:38,650 --> 00:58:39,820
It's like we're floating on the sea.

1335
00:58:39,820 --> 00:58:40,890
(It feels like floating on the sea.)

1336
00:58:41,290 --> 00:58:44,030
I feel like the train is going to fall off the cliff.

1337
00:58:44,130 --> 00:58:45,230
Terrifying.

1338
00:58:45,230 --> 00:58:47,660
- It's crazy.
- It's mad.

1339
00:58:48,600 --> 00:58:49,900
Look there. It's so beautiful.

1340
00:58:50,030 --> 00:58:51,370
What a spectacular view!

1341
00:58:51,370 --> 00:58:55,640
(Staring at the scenery that is like a watercolour painting,)

1342
00:58:55,840 --> 00:58:57,670
It's super romantic.

1343
00:58:57,670 --> 00:58:59,670
(they get drenched in the romantic mood.)

1344
00:59:05,350 --> 00:59:07,650
The ocean is huge.

1345
00:59:09,680 --> 00:59:10,890
Gosh, I can't believe...

1346
00:59:17,630 --> 00:59:19,460
The only flaw is that we can't sleep.

1347
00:59:19,960 --> 00:59:21,100
We can never sleep here.

1348
00:59:22,730 --> 00:59:25,200
(But Joon falls asleep right away.)

1349
00:59:28,370 --> 00:59:30,940
(His head keeps falling.)

1350
00:59:31,110 --> 00:59:34,240
(Hyun Moo can't take his eyes off the scenery.)

1351
00:59:34,340 --> 00:59:39,180
(What is everyone thinking while looking at the view?)

1352
00:59:39,180 --> 00:59:40,850
(Lang Co Station)

1353
00:59:40,850 --> 00:59:42,050
It's a small local station.

1354
00:59:43,450 --> 00:59:45,090
It's so pretty.

1355
00:59:45,090 --> 00:59:46,490
(A warm, familiar scene like Korea in the 90s)

1356
00:59:46,620 --> 00:59:50,220
Train to Chuncheon

1357
00:59:50,220 --> 00:59:51,290
(They get off the train to enjoy the short break.)

1358
00:59:51,290 --> 00:59:53,860
Let's get off the train.

1359
00:59:57,930 --> 01:00:00,700
(Lang Co Station)

1360
01:00:00,700 --> 01:00:02,200
The train is pretty.

1361
01:00:03,670 --> 01:00:04,770
It's a pretty train.

1362
01:00:05,270 --> 01:00:06,410
It's nicely decorated.

1363
01:00:10,650 --> 01:00:11,750
Do you want to take a photo?

1364
01:00:12,380 --> 01:00:13,780
Go stand there.

1365
01:00:14,650 --> 01:00:15,750
Right.

1366
01:00:20,590 --> 01:00:23,420
(Joon tries his best to look nice.)

1367
01:00:23,420 --> 01:00:25,330
(He's not frowning. He's focused.)

1368
01:00:28,800 --> 01:00:29,960
I took an amazing photo.

1369
01:00:30,500 --> 01:00:31,570
Did you?

1370
01:00:33,400 --> 01:00:35,170
(What do you think?)

1371
01:00:36,940 --> 01:00:39,340
(Groans)

1372
01:00:39,540 --> 01:00:41,710
(Did he take a photo of the train track?)

1373
01:00:42,040 --> 01:00:43,140
Let me try it.

1374
01:00:43,140 --> 01:00:44,810
(He can't say anything bad.)

1375
01:00:47,080 --> 01:00:49,380
(Hyun Moo's Concept: Cheerful)

1376
01:00:49,820 --> 01:00:50,890
Burst mode?

1377
01:00:51,120 --> 01:00:52,220
Let me see it.

1378
01:00:53,790 --> 01:00:54,990
I look like a madman.

1379
01:00:55,790 --> 01:00:56,890
"Whispering Corridors."

1380
01:00:57,560 --> 01:00:58,760
"Whispering Corridors."

1381
01:00:58,760 --> 01:00:59,960
(2026 version "Whispering Hyun Moo")

1382
01:01:03,330 --> 01:01:05,530
You look like the gorilla stuck to a sign in LA.

1383
01:01:06,670 --> 01:01:07,770
Ice cream.

1384
01:01:07,770 --> 01:01:09,500
(Vietnam's heat makes them crave ice cream.)

1385
01:01:09,670 --> 01:01:11,340
Ice cream? It's ice cream.

1386
01:01:12,410 --> 01:01:13,910
There's watermelon and coconut.

1387
01:01:14,240 --> 01:01:15,380
- There's chocolate too.
- Chocolate.

1388
01:01:15,380 --> 01:01:16,380
(Cold ice cream will help them beat the heat.)

1389
01:01:16,380 --> 01:01:18,150
- I want the chocolate.
- I want the coconut.

1390
01:01:20,750 --> 01:01:21,850
It's good.

1391
01:01:21,850 --> 01:01:22,980
(The cold and sweet ice cream cools them down.)

1392
01:01:23,890 --> 01:01:25,590
(I need...)

1393
01:01:25,590 --> 01:01:26,950
(two of these.)

1394
01:01:27,790 --> 01:01:28,820
Here.

1395
01:01:29,220 --> 01:01:30,660
- One more.
- One more.

1396
01:01:31,560 --> 01:01:32,690
We can communicate now.

1397
01:01:33,060 --> 01:01:34,160
Here.

1398
01:01:34,560 --> 01:01:35,900
It's 50 cents per ice cream.

1399
01:01:36,060 --> 01:01:37,800
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

1400
01:01:39,030 --> 01:01:40,330
Should we eat it on the train?

1401
01:01:40,330 --> 01:01:41,700
- We should go inside.
- Let's eat it inside. It's hot.

1402
01:01:41,970 --> 01:01:45,240
(While Joon is in the restroom,)

1403
01:01:46,470 --> 01:01:50,450
(Hyun Moo eats his ice cream.)

1404
01:01:51,610 --> 01:01:53,580
(The chocolate coating falls.)

1405
01:01:53,680 --> 01:01:56,020
(I can't lose any of it.)

1406
01:01:56,150 --> 01:01:59,890
(He eats the fallen bits and finishes the ice cream too.)

1407
01:02:00,590 --> 01:02:02,520
Let's all go on a vacation

1408
01:02:03,460 --> 01:02:06,130
(Let's go to Huế!)

1409
01:02:09,430 --> 01:02:11,830
(Lang Co Station)

1410
01:02:11,830 --> 01:02:13,470
(As the train runs, the scenery changes.)

1411
01:02:13,470 --> 01:02:14,670
It's changed.

1412
01:02:14,670 --> 01:02:15,740
It's different.

1413
01:02:15,740 --> 01:02:19,610
(After 4 hours, they finally enter downtown Huế.)

1414
01:02:20,040 --> 01:02:22,110
(Let's see.)

1415
01:02:22,110 --> 01:02:24,550
What's the dish you must eat in Huế, Vietnam?

1416
01:02:25,350 --> 01:02:28,050
When you are in Huế, you must eat the following dishes.

1417
01:02:28,280 --> 01:02:30,050
Bún bò Huế is a rich and spicy beef rice noodle dish...

1418
01:02:30,220 --> 01:02:32,320
that is very popular in Huế.

1419
01:02:32,320 --> 01:02:33,390
That sounds delicious.

1420
01:02:33,390 --> 01:02:34,960
The noodles are round and fat,

1421
01:02:34,960 --> 01:02:37,790
and the rich and spicy lemongrass broth...

1422
01:02:37,790 --> 01:02:38,830
- This is great.
- satisfies the Korean palate.

1423
01:02:38,830 --> 01:02:40,500
- It sounds good, doesn't it?
- Bún bò Huế.

1424
01:02:40,500 --> 01:02:41,530
(It's a perfect dish for Koreans missing the taste of home.)

1425
01:02:42,030 --> 01:02:43,970
I think you mix rice in it.

1426
01:02:43,970 --> 01:02:45,330
(AI's 2nd recommendation is cơm hến.)

1427
01:02:45,630 --> 01:02:48,170
It's a freshwater clam mixed rice...

1428
01:02:48,770 --> 01:02:51,070
with crispy fried pork rind.

1429
01:02:51,410 --> 01:02:53,940
It's a Huế delicacy. You mix rice with peanuts and herbs.

1430
01:02:53,940 --> 01:02:55,140
(It's the local delicacy you can only eat in Huế.)

1431
01:02:55,140 --> 01:02:56,140
All right.

1432
01:02:56,140 --> 01:02:57,610
- Bún bò Huế, it is.
- Bún bò Huế, it is.

1433
01:02:57,610 --> 01:02:59,650
- Bún bò Huế.
- Spicy beef rice noodles.

1434
01:02:59,650 --> 01:03:00,650
Yes.

1435
01:03:01,420 --> 01:03:03,120
I am really craving something spicy.

1436
01:03:03,120 --> 01:03:04,120
(He searches for the restaurants that sell bún bò Huế.)

1437
01:03:04,420 --> 01:03:05,720
Closed?

1438
01:03:06,390 --> 01:03:07,390
What?

1439
01:03:07,790 --> 01:03:08,820
What?

1440
01:03:09,260 --> 01:03:10,360
It's only 11am.

1441
01:03:10,360 --> 01:03:11,590
(It's 11am, and the shop is already closed.)

1442
01:03:11,890 --> 01:03:14,500
(They can't go to a bún bò Huế restaurant.)

1443
01:03:15,060 --> 01:03:17,730
Then where can we have good cơm hến?

1444
01:03:18,730 --> 01:03:21,800
The most popular local spot for cơm hến is Cơm Hến Hoa Đông.

1445
01:03:21,800 --> 01:03:24,270
- Cơm Hến Hoa Đông.
- It's 17 Hàn Mặc Tử Street.

1446
01:03:24,270 --> 01:03:26,670
It's 17 Hàn Mặc Tử Street. Cơm Hến Hoa Đông.

1447
01:03:26,810 --> 01:03:29,510
How does AI know everything?

1448
01:03:30,180 --> 01:03:31,410
I suddenly became really curious.

1449
01:03:31,410 --> 01:03:33,250
Does it know everything about the world?

1450
01:03:33,250 --> 01:03:34,420
It knows everything.

1451
01:03:36,350 --> 01:03:38,090
Finally, we're here. It's 11:30am.

1452
01:03:38,090 --> 01:03:39,220
(Departed Da Nang at 7:05am, Arrived in Huế at 11:30am)

1453
01:03:39,220 --> 01:03:41,660
- It took four hours. It's far.
- Yes.

1454
01:03:41,920 --> 01:03:42,920
It is.

1455
01:03:43,990 --> 01:03:46,230
- Bye. Thank you.
- Bye.

1456
01:03:48,530 --> 01:03:50,630
Now I feel like we're abroad.

1457
01:03:50,630 --> 01:03:52,630
- It does feel that way.
- Finally, I feel like we're abroad.

1458
01:03:52,830 --> 01:03:54,200
It's very authentic.

1459
01:03:54,200 --> 01:03:55,470
(The authentic scenery is complemented by the blue sky.)

1460
01:03:55,470 --> 01:03:56,470
It's beautiful.

1461
01:03:56,470 --> 01:03:59,310
(A classical French brick building)

1462
01:03:59,470 --> 01:04:02,040
(Huế Station)

1463
01:04:02,710 --> 01:04:03,780
It's nice.

1464
01:04:03,780 --> 01:04:06,110
(Welcome to Huế.)

1465
01:04:06,850 --> 01:04:08,950
- Goodness.
- Oh, my gosh.

1466
01:04:09,050 --> 01:04:10,050
So hot!

1467
01:04:10,690 --> 01:04:12,450
- Gosh.
- It's so hot.

1468
01:04:12,450 --> 01:04:15,960
This is Vietnam.

1469
01:04:15,960 --> 01:04:17,160
It's hot.

1470
01:04:17,460 --> 01:04:18,730
It's scorching hot.

1471
01:04:19,660 --> 01:04:21,000
I can't open my eyes.

1472
01:04:21,000 --> 01:04:22,460
So this is how hot it gets.

1473
01:04:24,970 --> 01:04:27,540
It's just 15 minutes away, so instead of getting a taxi,

1474
01:04:27,540 --> 01:04:28,570
why don't we ride a motorcycle?

1475
01:04:28,570 --> 01:04:29,600
- Since it's hot?
- Should we?

1476
01:04:29,600 --> 01:04:30,870
- Wouldn't that be better?
- That would be cool.

1477
01:04:31,370 --> 01:04:33,670
They are not aggressive, so they won't scam us.

1478
01:04:34,240 --> 01:04:35,380
Right?

1479
01:04:35,380 --> 01:04:37,140
If they grab you, it means they will scam you.

1480
01:04:37,510 --> 01:04:39,210
- They are not aggressive.
- They are not.

1481
01:04:39,210 --> 01:04:41,080
- "Hire us if you want." - They are passive.

1482
01:04:41,680 --> 01:04:42,980
Hello.

1483
01:04:43,250 --> 01:04:44,250
Here?

1484
01:04:44,750 --> 01:04:46,650
- Okay.
- Hoa Đông.

1485
01:04:47,050 --> 01:04:48,460
How much?

1486
01:04:48,460 --> 01:04:50,190
(It's not easy to communicate in English.)

1487
01:04:50,320 --> 01:04:52,930
How much is it?

1488
01:04:55,660 --> 01:04:58,400
(Even in Vietnamese, it's not easy to communicate.)

1489
01:04:58,470 --> 01:05:00,800
There's no point in asking them in Vietnamese.

1490
01:05:00,800 --> 01:05:02,600
- We...
- We can't understand the answer.

1491
01:05:02,600 --> 01:05:04,340
When we ask in Vietnamese, they answer in Vietnamese.

1492
01:05:04,340 --> 01:05:05,470
I'll use this.

1493
01:05:05,910 --> 01:05:07,110
How much?

1494
01:05:07,780 --> 01:05:10,440
(The translation app and calculator are travel essentials.)

1495
01:05:10,980 --> 01:05:12,410
It's about 25,000 dong.

1496
01:05:13,150 --> 01:05:14,180
It's cheap.

1497
01:05:14,250 --> 01:05:16,020
- Per person...
- Take a zero out.

1498
01:05:16,020 --> 01:05:17,080
It's 1.20 dollars.

1499
01:05:17,650 --> 01:05:19,620
- Okay.
- Nice. Wait.

1500
01:05:19,620 --> 01:05:20,620
- Hyun Moo.
- Yes?

1501
01:05:20,620 --> 01:05:21,620
Don't you want to wear sunscreen?

1502
01:05:22,690 --> 01:05:24,330
- Okay.
- You will get burned.

1503
01:05:24,330 --> 01:05:25,430
You will get seriously burned.

1504
01:05:25,430 --> 01:05:28,100
- Really? I never wear it.
- You have to.

1505
01:05:28,630 --> 01:05:31,800
(He's lazy, but he listens to his buddy.)

1506
01:05:34,600 --> 01:05:35,670
Hop on.

1507
01:05:35,670 --> 01:05:37,470
(They take a motorcycle instead of a taxi.)

1508
01:05:39,270 --> 01:05:40,270
Yes.

1509
01:05:45,780 --> 01:05:48,780
In Vietnam, people often ride motorcycles...

1510
01:05:48,780 --> 01:05:52,090
to move around narrow streets easily.

1511
01:05:53,320 --> 01:05:57,960
(A total of 77 million motorcycles are registered in Vietnam.)

1512
01:05:57,960 --> 01:06:02,360
This means 7 out of 10 people own a motorcycle.

1513
01:06:02,660 --> 01:06:06,170
(In Vietnam, motorcycles are a part of life.)

1514
01:06:09,340 --> 01:06:11,770
Let's go!

1515
01:06:13,740 --> 01:06:15,280
From Huế Station,

1516
01:06:15,280 --> 01:06:17,610
we're headed to the restaurant I searched on the train using AI.

1517
01:06:18,150 --> 01:06:19,980
This restaurant is known for...

1518
01:06:20,350 --> 01:06:24,850
a dish called cơm hến, which is like a freshwater clam soup.

1519
01:06:25,390 --> 01:06:27,590
So we will head to Cơm Hến Hoa Đông.

1520
01:06:28,260 --> 01:06:30,090
Joon's following us.

1521
01:06:30,090 --> 01:06:32,530
(Joon is following him.)

1522
01:06:33,860 --> 01:06:35,500
In front of me is...

1523
01:06:36,500 --> 01:06:39,670
the motorcycle taxi driver. You're supposed to hug him.

1524
01:06:39,670 --> 01:06:40,970
It's called Xe ôm here.

1525
01:06:42,300 --> 01:06:44,000
He's driving very safely.

1526
01:06:44,000 --> 01:06:46,340
(Xe ôm is a popular local transportation.)

1527
01:06:48,480 --> 01:06:50,340
It's scary on a motorcycle.

1528
01:06:51,150 --> 01:06:54,420
(Joon is scared to ride the motorcycle.)

1529
01:06:55,580 --> 01:06:56,820
Gosh, that's loud.

1530
01:06:58,190 --> 01:06:59,990
I wish he would go slower.

1531
01:07:01,360 --> 01:07:03,790
If I'm too scared, the driver...

1532
01:07:04,430 --> 01:07:07,400
might get annoyed, so I should stay quiet.

1533
01:07:08,060 --> 01:07:09,900
Nice.

1534
01:07:10,660 --> 01:07:11,670
Nice.

1535
01:07:11,670 --> 01:07:13,270
(Half scared and half thrilled)

1536
01:07:13,470 --> 01:07:14,570
Aren't you scared?

1537
01:07:14,700 --> 01:07:15,740
I'm not scared. Are you scared?

1538
01:07:15,740 --> 01:07:17,370
I'm scared to ride in the back of a motorcycle.

1539
01:07:17,540 --> 01:07:20,040
Your muscles are only for showing off.

1540
01:07:20,780 --> 01:07:22,380
You're a chicken.

1541
01:07:22,380 --> 01:07:25,680
To be fair, it was really hot, but it's quite breezy now.

1542
01:07:30,350 --> 01:07:32,350
The sky is beautiful.

1543
01:07:34,190 --> 01:07:36,520
Huế is Gyeongju of Vietnam. It lives up to its fame, doesn't it?

1544
01:07:36,520 --> 01:07:38,090
There are lots of historic sites.

1545
01:07:41,230 --> 01:07:46,630
(Historic sites preserve traces of a bygone dynasty.)

1546
01:07:48,370 --> 01:07:54,180
(A cityscape in harmony with the sky)

1547
01:07:54,180 --> 01:07:55,610
This must be the downtown.

1548
01:07:55,610 --> 01:07:56,980
There's a college.

1549
01:07:57,110 --> 01:07:59,780
(Huế University)

1550
01:08:03,820 --> 01:08:07,120
(Staring)

1551
01:08:08,590 --> 01:08:10,190
- Wait, I know you!
- Have you ever seen it?

1552
01:08:10,190 --> 01:08:12,060
- Thank you!
- I love you!

1553
01:08:13,260 --> 01:08:14,700
She recognised me.

1554
01:08:15,330 --> 01:08:17,200
- You're an MC, right?
- Yes.

1555
01:08:17,200 --> 01:08:19,170
- You are Jun Hyun Moo, right?
- Yes.

1556
01:08:19,170 --> 01:08:20,770
Yes!

1557
01:08:20,770 --> 01:08:23,170
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

1558
01:08:23,170 --> 01:08:26,140
She knows that I'm an MC.

1559
01:08:26,140 --> 01:08:28,980
(Turns out today is the university graduation day.)

1560
01:08:28,980 --> 01:08:30,740
Hello.

1561
01:08:31,450 --> 01:08:33,050
- Hello.
- Hello.

1562
01:08:33,050 --> 01:08:34,380
You remember the TV show?

1563
01:08:34,380 --> 01:08:35,580
- Yes!
- The name.

1564
01:08:35,580 --> 01:08:37,220
I saw you a lot.

1565
01:08:37,320 --> 01:08:38,320
Yes?

1566
01:08:38,790 --> 01:08:39,890
